NEXUS v1.8.0 release intent

This file requests evaluation of the exact commit containing it against the fail-closed v1.8 independent-rebuild release gate.

Required boundary:
- historical v1.7.0 remains unchanged;
- the exact intent commit must pass NEXUS Verification;
- two separate GitHub-hosted rebuild jobs must checkout that same exact SHA;
- both rebuilds must use the repository Dockerfile with digest-pinned Rust base;
- both must independently extract /usr/local/bin/nexus and produce exactly equal SHA-256 digests;
- reconciled evidence must contain no secret value and must record Authority Expansion: NONE;
- production must not be mutated by v1.8;
- no Railway service, volume, deployment, or paid upgrade is authorized or required;
- the release gate must independently validate the verification run and rebuild evidence before creating v1.8.0.

No PASS or seal may be inferred from this intent file itself.
